A. Liquidity Coverage Ratio (LCR)
60 An NBFC shall maintain an adequate level of unencumbered HQLA that can be converted into cash to meet its liquidity needs for a 30 calendar-day time horizon under a significantly severe liquidity stress scenario as specified in the Directions.
